  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Experience laid-back luxury at this Blue Mountain Beach vacation rental, perfectly positioned for family fun and coastal relaxation. With 4 bedrooms across 3 spacious levels, this home features a screened-in balcony, grill, and 2 living areas. Walk or bike to the beach, explore nearby trails, and enjoy easy access to dining and shopping—all from a thoughtfully designed home base with a fully stocked kitchen.<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Location perks: Blue Mountain Beach Access (0.4 miles), Point Washington State Forest Trails (0.6 miles), Gulf Place Town Center (2.1 miles), Grayton Beach State Park (3.2 miles), Seaside (4.3 miles)<br><br><br><br>Interior:<br><br> — Kitchen (drip coffee maker, Keurig, blender, cooking utensils, tableware)<br><br> — 5 Smart TVs with cable<br><br> — Central heat and A/C<br><br> — In-unit washer and dryer<br><br> — Free WiFi <br><br> — 2 living rooms<br><br> — 2,872 sq. ft.<br><br><br><br>Exterior:<br><br>— Gas grill<br><br>— Screened balcony with seating<br><br>— Outdoor dining area (seats 12)<br><br>— Bike rack<br><br>— Outdoor shower<br><br>— On-site parking for 2 cars (driveway only)<br><br><br><br>First Floor: Kitchen, dining area, living room, half bathroom<br><br>Second floor: 2 bedrooms (king beds), 2 en-suite bathrooms, <br><br>Third Floor: 1 bunk room ( 4 full-sized beds (2 sets of bunk beds)., 1 full bathroom, 1 Living Room, 1 bedroom (king bed), 1 en-suite bathroom,<br><br><br><br>Local rental license number:<br><br><br><br>Guest Access:<br><br>Guests have full access to the home, including both living rooms, grill, balconies, and in-unit laundry. Parking is available for 2 cars in the driveway. This home has a pack and play for guest use.<br><br><br><br>The Neighborhood:<br><br>This home is nestled in the laid-back community of Blue Mountain Beach, a beloved 30A locale known for its relaxed vibe and natural beauty. Guests can walk to the beach, or explore nearby trails in Point Washington State Forest. Local shops, cafes, and bike rentals are within a quick drive, and nearby towns like Grayton Beach and Seaside offer vibrant dining and arts scenes.<br><br><br><br>Getting Around:<br><br>A car is recommended for broader area access. The beach, trailheads, and restaurants are all within a mile or two. There is no public transit nearby.<br><br><br><br>Other Things to Note:<br><br>Please keep in mind that if you plan to swim, you are responsible for verifying local beach conditions and flag warnings.<br><br><br><br>Two stair steps are required to access the entry. Interior spans 3 levels.<br><br><br><br>Interaction with Guests:<br><br>We are offsite but available when needed. Please message us through the app or booking platform for the quickest response.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
